Scope

This license covers the code and tools written for this repository:
client/ (vc_lc.asi), include/vc_lc.inc, tools/, and the ColAndreas collision
code added to the filterscripts.

It does not cover the game content. The maps, models (models/), object
placements, paths, zone data and radar art come from Grand Theft Auto: Vice City
and Grand Theft Auto III, (c) Rockstar Games, by way of the GTA:United
conversion and the VC2SA / LC2SA 4 SAMP filterscripts. They belong to their
respective owners and are included only so the maps can be used on SA-MP /
open.mp servers. The data derived from them (scriptfiles/GPS_VC.dat,
scriptfiles/GPS_LC.dat, maps/vc.png, maps/lc.png and the zone coordinates) is
covered the same way.
